    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ios21">
        <head xml:id="gom-ios21-Hd1e98">Caput 21</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios21-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios21-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios21-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0519D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios21-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios21_1@1-1">Accesserunt.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios21-Rd1e111"><name xml:id="gom-ios21-Nd1e112" ref="#Origen">ADAM.</name>, hom. 25 in Jos.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios21-Qd1e116"><seg type="qs">Omnes filii Israel acceperunt sortes suas in terra</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et recumbet cum Abraham, cum Isaac et Jacob in regno coelorum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios21-d1e124">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios21-Rd1e126" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ios21_1@1-1"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios21-Rd1e128"><name xml:id="gom-ios21-Nd1e129" ref="#Origen">ADAMANT.</name> hom. 26.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios21-Qd1e133"><seg type="qs">Supra dictum est</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">orbem terrae implevit, et dona spiritalia credentibus tribuit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios21-Dd1e142">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios21-Hd1e144">Versus 39</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios21-d1e146">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios21-Qd1e148" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios21_39@1-1">Itaque.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios21-Rd1e151"><name xml:id="gom-ios21-Nd1e152" ref="#IsidoreOfSeville">ISID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios21-Qd1e155">Quod quadraginta duae urbes accipiunt Levitae, praedicatio significatur sanctorum. Ipsi enim possident doctrinam, quae constat <pb ed="#P" n="0520A"/> ex decalogo legis, et quadrifario numero Evangelii, quasi quaterdenas urbes habentes: quibus etiam adduntur duae; quia cuncta quae praedicant, morali et mystico sensu annuntiant.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios21-Dd1e162">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios21-Hd1e164">Versus 41</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios21-d1e166">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios21-Qd1e168" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios21_41@1-2">Deditque Dominus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios21-Rd1e171"><name xml:id="gom-ios21-Nd1e172" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 21.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios21-Qd1e176"><seg type="qs">Quaeritur cum Israel non solum usque ad diem mortis Jesu</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">jam data fuerat in quamdam exercitationis utilitatem.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios21-Dd1e185">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios21-Hd1e187">Versus 42</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios21-d1e189">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios21-Qd1e191" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios21_42@11-12">Nullusque eis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios21-Rd1e194"><name xml:id="gom-ios21-Nd1e195" ref="#Augustine">ID.</name>, quaest. 22.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios21-Qd1e199"><seg type="qs">Quod ait</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">antequam singulis tribubus sua loca defendenda dividerentur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
